# Integer16 power promotes mixed operands

Verifies int8 and int16 power promotes the base and exponent to int16 while
preserving the source operand order.

>>> source
narrow: int8 = 2
wide: int16 = 3

narrow_base: int16 = narrow ** wide
wide_base: int16 = wide ** narrow
print(narrow_base)
print(wide_base)

<<< stdout
8
9

<<< stderr
